      "source_text": "直线",
      "source_fingerprint": "c94b5ebf51692703d1f83b71c71d28e3c5a39ce0159c869f58275071ff3ab7fe",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df759d0f03e4502af93a8697",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "报酬一览",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea200d78f55203af7cc56c2abb1ea78cb8f71ac00abfc4b1c667b69b4158564c",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0260"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b6d9c996c31de1973e0fc4",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "准备再看一次比赛\n\n确定吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1e3c0f85a49754a02b60870a0e6e807cb0c426a0991f82193da0bf182776292",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16aa3b1b671bf47a659fc507",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "不在可参赛的时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d853e346cdfece4462a8dd6ccc78a9df8559484d486328a175b58f3b5d997b6",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0336"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bee43d9eb27435a24bfdf90",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "下项",
      "source_fingerprint": "699c13a87100f0fb37d704efec3a26e6da981957c85033ea2433b1cdd9f1cf9f",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:323604d35cf1afa2146f9335",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "重播",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c5a69acca79ce26591aee4750169eac1c004f09b229ca930ecda8950034b347",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0410"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95fec080c5556983c35c44cf",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "第{0}话",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c9f5bebbcacb99418387ace1a3837ce92c455ada999562854501574be70452",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0457"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11690c70349d613ef6de8f6c",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "观看前一话后解锁",
      "source_fingerprint": "67bf8cec7965edc38bd0d2c405cafcb5c13a76aa07ccd2f66dd906c6af3a00f9",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0459"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:462db4449b3fa09fbb847e4a",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "真是一场精彩的比赛呢！　粉丝和队友的应援\n也提供了力量，跑的很棒呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4bf8c9dcc7dfae46373d7f2d36b464e00eed2077c46fe6eaa1f6b61d33e187",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0460"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:802949a85c07cb55afd0e1c0",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "虽然没能获得第一，但这是一场\n引发观众热烈欢呼的精彩比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55937b8b1447d8fdd0921f2d9a5d42dc8cea193f5a470ed04e81d172a5ca3316",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7045f01581afa3c544d7f594",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "真是一场精彩的比赛呢！　这是队伍中的\n大家努力奔跑的结果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8a43659efdce4a216267355d5bd7d7ae95fb766b068b7c28f3339167da7fc91",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0462"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0613fe40565042dddd9d22b8",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "虽然错过了第1名，但是得到了观众的热烈欢呼\n也算一场不错的比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72c2c306f7df3cb4085a7b57761fe3f4a0e5de8013b1f7ec08d8cbf5d4b1a478",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0463"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b046129af8e98420da711a52",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "非常不错的比赛呢！\n也期待更广阔的世界的比赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "252e6f2f8d0a92e19eb744a07979cdf9f0c0491abf67ddbcd729ae494f43a9ee",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0464"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa66f56d776e95db2da7f3b",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "虽然失败很可惜，但我认为我们面对这些对手\n已经有足够的实力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56b7575b345eed4d66041d789f66c005c4aeae155680e2f390907eea44291393",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0465"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b8ae75eb378408bb2432d9f",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "恭喜获胜！与强大的赛马娘对手们\n进行了一场精彩的比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac79a32d7cad8f63bf561ad8e94ab83f1a09a00c28e6ed8d2fdb9ee619ab4a1",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0466"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94e958b9c8b4e13711dfe138",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "离胜利还差一步了呢。\n面对强大的赛马娘对手们有好好努力过了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea6403ebb5cf3eda85e1e36033e3a2bde8da2bdd71596e00df4c8e5f5f7c107",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0467"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bcb5d17761bf3e9ecdd370f",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "恭喜！\n积累平时的胜利是很重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69cdaddbbc0631e4f84559e9e783c300ccb44492b3243d39de3d88908273bbc",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0479"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76173ee232d16c0bf738aa85",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "就差一点点了呢。但也从失败中学到了东西\n将其活用到下次比赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f807df8f579ff22ae37a465aefee74e89846e949fe68a09cab1a676416bd986",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0480"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c1cbd13408e206939ef86c",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "恭喜获胜！　能在有强大对手参赛的比赛中\n获胜是很了不起的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f6529f68eeaf560ef517d844190a30110bf27fe13cd9c316159f67eca6c9b12",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd5e3847e3f74ab0c9a262e",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "让优胜逃走了呢。\n在有强敌的情况下战斗能够增强自信呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b3c6cbbf6b47bdc4b4211c9476a077b9612999834843b152cf4dea1e27b73e5",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0482"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35e2bc92fc4e9f44845af45e",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "恭喜取得初次胜利！\n千里之行始于足下，新的传说开始了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc90f0ef9354891be57bdc628a4606a12760fac3ce1b4afdba949f3978f7b48b",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0484"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85849403833cf78e8cf05646",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "恭喜！\n保持这种状态继续取胜吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f5cdf47161d9121478e54ed301c4519731427fe5ea5984eb057e36bf2725599",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0485"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f55a45f41b8167c046b17749",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "干的不错呢！\n继续以优胜为目标加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7deb906bd97ebac55310fb4384bdbff1bf9b393b6cd294cd88535ce10963a88",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0486"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b07280c4b376c297e81173e",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "恭喜获胜！　在强力赛马娘云集\n的比赛中取得了漂亮的胜利呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13a1a9bb0a8eaa95054fb72232cb33c829fc95fc409a0e340d951d5935d06902",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0487"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e304df2b6e93c70aa5347c2b",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "就差一点了呢。虽然胜负的世界很残酷，\n但今后还有很长的路呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2cd3e2038e12224cf4936adc2e07acaae03284b9f4062723e041a8608ab3ad8",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0490"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c233787ac2c934102dfba9cf",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "虽然差一点就能取得胜利，\n但这是一场能够连接下一场的好比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7b4b78315ffafbe3e36218937e8e13c1ad6df2f0ae3b0135639e142f96e2783",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0491"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab8a1affad97e03b7b84f1f",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "离胜利还有一点距离呢。虽然结果有点遗憾\n但也显示出了实力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ad35d3014a41755ec060c113d4c1373128d301e9d5c6b67a57880fa79e272a2",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0492"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9edcd11ce76d5f677b067285",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "非常可惜。虽然错过了优胜\n但比赛很充实呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19ac6f4355876da2303435679fcc9e6b886fec89117ad4cdefabb85a4ac5b2b",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0493"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d04cecc2b4d96f74887fa1b0",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "选择{0}策略的对手很多呢。相同策略人数太多\n的话会很难取胜，试试不同的作战策略吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c22d4d0b72a1fd4a93d03971054ba79e4531327256bc2d4c5c31e5a71188538",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0496"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ed4a00becf1a8ac741722b6",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "有点缺乏冷静力呢。步调乱了的话\n会浪费体力，提高一下智力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2beef5ee1966081257e2ba846866e5c828e7cc03be62f2dbaaefcb1ab9dddd9e",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0498"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bc3fe7887b4a5be8e7f61ff",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "比赛时步调乱了，\n好像没能冷静地跑呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43c6f96a670f9fc305380a28977468e6328fd15d07c2d50a6c66d0ef08bffc9c",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0499"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eb1ce2050913caa338ded61",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "比起其他赛马娘来看根性不足，终盘时好像\n体力耗尽了。提升根性来增强竞争心吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39bfb266cdfc947a9deb598d16d8c5c9bb4873b50bfb3505f9012e75b384338a",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252f0d1e1145fe0b81b43191",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "比起其他赛马娘来看根性不足，\n终盘时貌似体力耗尽了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a840caef427a9905fc5f72ae9aa157c933076624a555d91a6368d72bfa536f2f",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17124424961da1792e7181f2",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "比赛途中好像体力耗尽而导致速度\n大幅下降了呢。试试提升耐力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3628dc2f592c72e94d26904b041e1b6b44764ba1fc7858252a9315e611cfadda",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0504"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbec772c283bddad1af873cb",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "比赛途中好像体力耗尽了，\n速度大幅下降了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8746d41d009aee88c1ba5fabf4b90c848ba72766f50a17f5b5109e00fb1dc5a8",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:438f1bc7afef87cad92a4930",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "好像没有为最终冲刺保存体力。\n锻炼一下耐力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8854fbdb854c57fa33001c196e409e53936219c45f483948d59d7bc33c759a8d",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0506"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef6eb887323e25f4dffaee51",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "好像没有为最终冲刺\n保留体力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f59b9baf46ba325917c597f38ae86ebb1294d05cd312461975a52b297caa04ed",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0507"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adb5c61e1020731d26140766",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺还有进步余地。为了能够达到最高速度\n提升耐力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "941b00192ce4b01014912ee288c9ee6ab171e8aafc4742e63e70a81252df7acf",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0508"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f3e1dfd16590be399d39eee",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "没能达到最高速度，最终冲刺还有\n进步余地呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "819b71683b1310bccf866e57634cb98188e1bde09ef90d030a7dbbf50ade2271",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0509"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f4d088d8537c036c7783e3a",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "拥有的技能似乎有些少呢。\n去获得更多的技能吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33a4b13f17169579d20a5e3c8beca8249ae2e829c2515197acaca8bdc8a91a5b",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0510"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8971f737a4837c04f4c57fe1",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "与排在前面的赛马娘比较的话\n拥有的技能好像有点少。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4508e2946a68baab5951d88c607b903fca7570f99c0ff3961de34080381d96b2",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f71db5b1bc2a24a96a29fb96",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "似乎被其他赛马娘挡住了，\n很难突破重围。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37ef7b811a6f624566c63c723769ea8707bf5a0ab5f3bc55ef74e1a3a1b3e64f",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0512"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9e420e8ac376f95a1a2dcf",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "好像被其他赛马娘挡住了，\n很难冲出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "832b6d678b3a1f21c1732eff032f82c72eb459075f46aa12bb34de69a8bb97a5",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0513"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5160471241a43f3bb98e5b4d",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "这一次错失了胜利呢。\n审视一下技能与基础能力间的平衡吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c037c15dc25051a9c9ac83669ed6dbc4e0fa96e2bf1d8e6ded6a2ac5b710ee08",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0514"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a98a1a32a1d16ecb96b8026",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "这一次错失了胜利呢。\n下次比赛再加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "919dbec6916f52cfe111b288264d472ce43a21062e34ea3572c15e37e5e55848",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0515"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f5743dc42e97992bdde7cdc",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "由于距离适性不符，未能完全发挥能力。\n选择距离适性等级较高的比赛距离吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8599370265ec84f2eb1dffdea247ddc0b407a5d160812d7c13f1359044e1762b",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0516"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd48b36bd2b168443031285",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "距离适应性不合适而导致没能发挥出能力呢。\n选择距离适应性等级高的距离吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9fa348c9733361d0ab6a534d716dacc13d23ec5642cc68526370c48d1469cc3",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0517"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:171637252d96e03b99000ee1",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "由于场地适性不符，未能完全发挥能力。\n选择场地适性等级较高的场地吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb1a593fa5ccde1aa000188f5af52a46497e8e36c84bc4a81083b1b096ca369",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0518"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4199a3ff6209503f4b32c171",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "马场适性不合适而导致没能发挥出能力呢。\n选择马场适性等级高的马场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "892510fdb3ec6ae3b3da8a3eca2bba90f1c3ce41997c81654a3dddc376ae004b",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0519"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a317f1f18594c709a66ddb5",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "比赛辛苦啦！如果能通过继承提高适性的话\n就有可能期待取胜吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64602802f3ce4aaa941d28fd7db2d41134a15f63a21002623ca94fac06af23a",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0520"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19a325da25c78cec99cae411",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "干劲低下，好像没能发挥出原本的能力。\n通过外出维持干劲吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f81bb28856121c766729e2c513b13f96cdfd050e7f49b2d4aa7d669c57968897",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0521"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c9b6fd539bfc5e0d96640d5",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "由于干劲低下，赛马娘好像没能\n发挥出原本的能力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0c85420361391d95be03607c956d20cf87d9f1092a9677759931e95699fc6b1",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "Race0522"
      ]
    },
